column-top-margin'     ><p>\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-93bxxm-4a05ebc0834c1fa65d7135aa09ad9246\">\n#top .av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-4a05ebc0834c1fa65d7135aa09ad9246{\npadding-bottom:20px;\nfont-size:40px;\n}\nbody .av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-4a05ebc0834c1fa65d7135aa09ad9246 .av-special-heading-tag .heading-char{\nfont-size:25px;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-4a05ebc0834c1fa65d7135aa09ad9246 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:40px;\n}\n.av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-4a05ebc0834c1fa65d7135aa09ad9246 .av-subheading{\nfont-size:15px;\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 480px) and (max-width: 767px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-4a05ebc0834c1fa65d7135aa09ad9246 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (max-width: 479px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-4a05ebc0834c1fa65d7135aa09ad9246 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-93bxxm-4a05ebc0834c1fa65d7135aa09ad9246 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote  avia-builder-el-14  el_before_av_hr  avia-builder-el-first  av-inherit-size'><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop=\"headline\"  >Packaging materials<\/h2><div class=\"special-heading-border\"><div class=\"special-heading-inner-border\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><br \/>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-8vz72i-4591fb7f6513e2fed5b15f92cc3251a7\">\n#top .hr.av-8vz72i-4591fb7f6513e2fed5b15f92cc3251a7{\nmargin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.hr.av-8vz72i-4591fb7f6513e2fed5b15f92cc3251a7 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-8vz72i-4591fb7f6513e2fed5b15f92cc3251a7 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-15  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_textblock  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><br \/>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-8gqcky-ac4fc8f8eb40153648667fd2f2312670 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>We make our packaging from high-pressure polyethylene using extrusion blow moulding. We make HDPE packaging for our own needs and for sale. We make packaging with capacities of 0.5 l, 1 l, 4 l, 5 l, 7 l, 10 l and 20 l.<\/p>\n<p>Modern machinery and qualified personnel with extensive experience guarantee the top-quality of our packaging. We offer our customers the opportunity to select the colour of the packaging and customise it to the needs of their own brands (private label). We can also make packaging with an extruded logo or name of the customer\u2019s business.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/p><\/div><\/p>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-aerdae-036e9fe60b5057638ce54101670c70b0\">\n.flex_column.av-aerdae-036e9fe60b5057638ce54101670c70b0{\nborder-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;\npadding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='flex_column av-aerdae-036e9fe60b5057638ce54101670c70b0 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-17  el_after_av_one_half  el_before_av_one_half  flex_column_div av-zero-column-padding  column-top-margin'     ><p>\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-lyg90e6w-15de15758fdf35c28a41a3657af3dffa\">\n#top .av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-15de15758fdf35c28a41a3657af3dffa{\npadding-bottom:20px;\nfont-size:40px;\n}\nbody .av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-15de15758fdf35c28a41a3657af3dffa .av-special-heading-tag .heading-char{\nfont-size:25px;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-15de15758fdf35c28a41a3657af3dffa .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:40px;\n}\n.av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-15de15758fdf35c28a41a3657af3dffa .av-subheading{\nfont-size:15px;\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 480px) and (max-width: 767px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-15de15758fdf35c28a41a3657af3dffa .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (max-width: 479px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-15de15758fdf35c28a41a3657af3dffa .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-lyg90e6w-15de15758fdf35c28a41a3657af3dffa av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote  avia-builder-el-18  el_before_av_hr  avia-builder-el-first  av-inherit-size'><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop=\"headline\"  >Packing process<\/h2><div class=\"special-heading-border\"><div class=\"special-heading-inner-border\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><br \/>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-97fvba-cfa9c6e567ff88280ef095df6dd27fba\">\n#top .hr.av-97fvba-cfa9c6e567ff88280ef095df6dd27fba{\nmargin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.hr.av-97fvba-cfa9c6e567ff88280ef095df6dd27fba .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-97fvba-cfa9c6e567ff88280ef095df6dd27fba hr-custom  avia-builder-el-19  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_textblock  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><br \/>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-lyg90ou3-15b1744a7974424a9a302f50ee91c78d '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>Our products are packed at modern, automated and robotised filling and packing lines. We have three fully automatic high-performance packing lines and three partially automated lines. The personnel make every effort to ensure that our products are packed in aesthetic, durable and correctly labelled packaging.<\/p>\n<p>The products leaving our factory are secured with a security seal. All of our production operations are monitored by a dedicated production management system (PMS) program.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/p><\/div>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-6x6u3a-70185925ab1605c0ac096fde76fa716e\">\n.flex_column.av-6x6u3a-70185925ab1605c0ac096fde76fa716e{\nborder-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;\npadding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='flex_column av-6x6u3a-70185925ab1605c0ac096fde76fa716e av_one_half  avia-builder-el-21  el_after_av_one_half  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_div av-zero-column-padding  column-top-margin'     ><p>\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-lyg919jt-c7d9a7f63c7fc9d978fb01ab4c4282e0\">\n#top .av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-c7d9a7f63c7fc9d978fb01ab4c4282e0{\npadding-bottom:20px;\nfont-size:40px;\n}\nbody .av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-c7d9a7f63c7fc9d978fb01ab4c4282e0 .av-special-heading-tag .heading-char{\nfont-size:25px;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-c7d9a7f63c7fc9d978fb01ab4c4282e0 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:40px;\n}\n.av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-c7d9a7f63c7fc9d978fb01ab4c4282e0 .av-subheading{\nfont-size:15px;\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 480px) and (max-width: 767px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-c7d9a7f63c7fc9d978fb01ab4c4282e0 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (max-width: 479px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-c7d9a7f63c7fc9d978fb01ab4c4282e0 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-lyg919jt-c7d9a7f63c7fc9d978fb01ab4c4282e0 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote  avia-builder-el-22  el_before_av_hr  avia-builder-el-first  av-inherit-size'><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop=\"headline\"  >Blending plant<\/h2><div class=\"special-heading-border\"><div class=\"special-heading-inner-border\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><br \/>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-5moo12-de410cde88bc16a3984cb8d7170bb2f0\">\n#top .hr.av-5moo12-de410cde88bc16a3984cb8d7170bb2f0{\nmargin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.hr.av-5moo12-de410cde88bc16a3984cb8d7170bb2f0 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-5moo12-de410cde88bc16a3984cb8d7170bb2f0 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-23  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_textblock  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><br \/>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-lyg91v0k-bcaf76031651a632c37fab3e63912be6 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>Oils are made at a modern and computerised blending plant with 7 mixers with a heating, dosing and filtration system.<\/p>\n<p>The dosing of raw materials to production and the transfer of finished products from the blending plant takes place via the PIGING system. The PIGING system is based on pistons located inside a pipeline and driven by compressed air.<\/p>\n<p>This guarantees reproducible and clean production because the pipelines are emptied and cleaned inside after each operation. It also ensures that we dose the precise amounts of the raw materials and prevents the mixing of different products. The entire blending process is monitored by qualified personnel.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/p><\/div>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-42zzti-e7264b2bbdc095bd0fd54145835c3084\">\n.flex_column.av-42zzti-e7264b2bbdc095bd0fd54145835c3084{\nborder-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;\npadding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='flex_column av-42zzti-e7264b2bbdc095bd0fd54145835c3084 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-25  el_after_av_one_half  avia-builder-el-last  flex_column_div av-zero-column-padding  column-top-margin'     ><p>\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-lyg92c79-8738975abb5096c6fb2f375306fb967e\">\n#top .av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-8738975abb5096c6fb2f375306fb967e{\npadding-bottom:20px;\nfont-size:40px;\n}\nbody .av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-8738975abb5096c6fb2f375306fb967e .av-special-heading-tag .heading-char{\nfont-size:25px;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-8738975abb5096c6fb2f375306fb967e .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:40px;\n}\n.av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-8738975abb5096c6fb2f375306fb967e .av-subheading{\nfont-size:15px;\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 480px) and (max-width: 767px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-8738975abb5096c6fb2f375306fb967e .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (max-width: 479px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-8738975abb5096c6fb2f375306fb967e .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-lyg92c79-8738975abb5096c6fb2f375306fb967e av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote  avia-builder-el-26  el_before_av_hr  avia-builder-el-first  av-inherit-size'><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop=\"headline\"  >Warehouse<\/h2><div class=\"special-heading-border\"><div class=\"special-heading-inner-border\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><br \/>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-31egyu-6f514170fdfc52417e6422db57280393\">\n#top .hr.av-31egyu-6f514170fdfc52417e6422db57280393{\nmargin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.hr.av-31egyu-6f514170fdfc52417e6422db57280393 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-31egyu-6f514170fdfc52417e6422db57280393 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-27  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_textblock  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><br \/>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-lyg92ooy-1a5e556eccbdbd40585a0e4d2f43e22f '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>We have several warehouses with a total capacity of 4500 pallet places. The individual warehouse sections use various warehouse support systems, such as the drive-in rack system, radio shuttle system and moving rack system. All these systems are associated with a warehouse management system (WMS), which ensures that the products are correctly stored, and their locations are fully identifiable.<\/p>\n<p>Warehouse operations take place using reliable reach trucks of STILL, HYSTER and JUNGHEINRICH. All of our machinery is based on electromobility, which supports environmental protection.<\/p>\n<p>We specialise in the loading of marine containers, which requires special solutions and precision during the distribution of the goods in the container.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/p><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":0,"parent":4207,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-4264","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4264","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4264"}],"version-history":[{"count":14,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4264\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5631,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4264\/revisions\/5631"}],"up":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4207"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4264"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}